    b -= 1
while a > 0:
    a -= 1
    b += 1
print(b)
```

## C 코드

```c
int a = 2;
int b = 2;
while(b > 0) {
    a++;    
    b--;     
}
while(a > 0) {
    a--;    
    b++;
}
printf("%d\n", b);
```

